-- lhohi
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Noonu Atoll, Northern Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 700 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"0.8 km long, 0.5 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"190 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Charming atmosphere, beautiful beaches, excellent snorkeling"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Cultural enthusiasts, beach lovers, snorkelers, families"}],"island_overview":["Lhohi Island is a charming local island in Noonu Atoll that offers visitors a delightful glimpse into authentic Maldivian life. This friendly island combines stunning natural beauty with a warm, welcoming atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking genuine cultural experiences and natural splendor.","Known for its beautiful beaches, crystal-clear lagoons, and excellent house reef, Lhohi provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and marine exploration. The island''s friendly community welcomes visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their charming way of life with genuine enthusiasm.","What makes Lhohi special is its charming atmosphere and beautiful natural setting. Visitors can enjoy stunning beaches, explore diverse marine life, and experience traditional island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the friendly Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Lhohi Island is strategically located in the northern part of Noonu Atoll, approximately 190 kilometers from Male. This location provides a charming and authentic experience while maintaining good accessibility to the capital and international airport through various transfer options.","The island''s position off