update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Thaa Atoll, Central Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,100 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.2 km long, 0.6 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"192 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Fantastic culture, magnificent beaches, excellent snorkeling"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, snorkelers, peaceful getaways"}],"island_overview":["Vilufushi Island is a fantastic local island in Thaa Atoll that offers visitors a charming glimpse into traditional Maldivian life. This delightful island combines natural beauty with a welcoming atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking wonderful cultural experiences and magnificent tropical surroundings.","Known for its lovely beaches, fantastic coral reefs, and excellent marine biodiversity, Vilufushi provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s charming community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their delightful way of life with fantastic hospitality.","What makes Vilufushi special is its fantastic natural environment and charming island setting. Visitors can enjoy magnificent beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience delightful island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the fantastic Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Vilufushi Island is beautifully located in the central part of Thaa Atoll, approximately 192 kilometers from Male. This location provides a fantastic and charming experience while maintaining good accessibility to the capital and international airport through various transfer options.","The island''s position offers excellent protection from strong currents while providing access to magnificent coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Thaa Atoll in its most fantastic form."]},{"heading":"Vilufushi: Fantastic Paradise & Marine Charm","paragraphs":["Vilufushi Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring magnificent white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most fantastic marine environments in Thaa Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in a charming, delightful setting."]},{"heading":"Magnificent White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Vilufushi features fantastic white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and delightful beach activities."]},{"heading":"Fantastic House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers charming snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Charming Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the delightful spirit of traditional island life with friendly locals and fantastic Maldivian culture in a charming community setting."]},{"heading":"Delightful Sandbank Adventures","paragraphs":["Explore nearby uninhabited sandbanks and fantastic islands around Vilufushi for magnificent tropical paradise experiences with rich marine life."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Vilufushi''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Vilufushi feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Vilufushi offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and fantastic activities. The island''s charming environment and delightful atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in a magnificent, peaceful setting."]},{"heading":"Fantastic House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the charming house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and excellent underwater visibility in fantastic waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby magnificent dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in fantastic marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, magnificent sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Thaa Atoll with charming exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in fantastic community settings."]},{"heading":"Delightful Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience fantastic Maldivian island life with charming cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy magnificent sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in fantastic waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Vilufushi is home to approximately 1,100 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and fantastic cultural traditions that create a charming atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Vilufushi follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, family, and community activities. The island maintains a fantastic atmosphere where visitors can experience charming Maldivian culture and customs in their most delightful, peaceful setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and fishing techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this fantastic island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Vilufushi has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and fantastic cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Vilufushi Island?","answer":"Regular ferry services are also available from Male and nearby islands in Thaa Atoll."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Vilufushi?","answer":"The best time to visit Vilufushi is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more fantastic local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Vilufushi?","answer":"Vilufushi offers various accommodations including fantastic guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in a charming setting."},{"question":"What makes Vilufushi''s charm special?","answer":"Vilufushi is known for its fantastic and charming natural environment. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering a delightful atmosphere perfect for peaceful exploration. Visitors can experience wonderful cultural exchanges and participate in fantastic community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["guraidhoo","gaadhiffushi","dhiyamigili","burunee","veymandoo","vandhoo","thimarafushi","omadhoo","madifushi","kinbidhoo","kandoodhoo","hirilandhoo"]}'::jsonb
